<p>One page per guarded include point:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="?call">call</a> - the page's own PHP throws</li>
  <li><a href="?once/index">once</a> - a lib include throws</li>
  <li><a href="?tag">tag</a> - an application tag throws</li>
  <li><a href="?go">go</a> - a built-in handler throws</li>
  <li><a href="?goNotOk">goNotOk</a> - the same, swallowed by notOk</li>
  <li><a href="?var">var</a> - a variable's pipe throws</li>
  <li><a href="?eval">eval</a> - an expression throws</li>
</ul>